      "title": "SK Minerals & Additives Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 555 million in funding from a group of investors",
      "body": "SK Minerals & Additives Limited announces a private placement to issue 6,000,000 convertible warrants at a price of INR 92.5 per warrant for gross proceeds of INR 555,000,000 on June 1, 2026. The exercise price of warrants is INR 277.5 per warrant. This has obtained approval from Board of directors. The transaction involves new investor participation from SK MINERALS TECH PVT LTD for 150,000 warrants, HEERA LINENS PRIVATE LIMITED for 50,000 warrants, Sunita Rani for 1,000,000 warrants, NEPTUNE FABRICS PRIVATE LIMITED for 50,000 warrants, HARTRON CASE COMMUNICATIONS PRIVATE LIMITED for 50,000 warrants, ALPASSO SOLAR ENERGY PRIVATE LIMITED for 50,000 warrants, SUMARG EDUCATION RESOURCES PRIVATE LIMITED for 50,000 warrants, ALGOMIND FINANCIAL SERVICES LLP for 20000 warrants, FYLFOT SECURITIES",
